------------------------------------------------------------
 1. PREREQUISITES ESTABLISHED FIRST
------------------------------------------------------------
The bench device had no CYVRA agent (0 of 333 packages), so it could not be
purged at all. Before any destructive step:

  - sanitization-agent-debug.apk installed  (needed `adb install -r -t`,
    because a debug build is flagged testOnly)
  - dpm set-device-owner .../SanitizationAdmin   -> Success
  - product pre-flight re-run                    -> ELIGIBLE

The entitlement flag SANITIZE_EXECUTE could NOT be set. wrangler is not
authenticated in this environment and no Cloudflare token exists here, so
that action remains with the Chief Engineer. Consequence recorded below in
section 4.

