  A1 total packages      = 334     (333 at the 14-Oct baseline, +1 = agent)
  A2 third-party         = 5       (4 at baseline, +1 = agent)
  A3 CYVRA packages      = 1       (the agent)
  A4 CYVRA owner refs    = 3
